# COMPONENT

## OperationContractSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.operationcontract

### DESCRIPTION

Operation contract grammar sample.

# SERVICE

## Greeting

### DESCRIPTION

Greeting operation contract sample.

### OPERATION

#### greeting

Returns a hello-world style greeting through the query path.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### SUMMARY

Return a greeting.

##### DESCRIPTION

Returns a greeting message for the supplied name.

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
GreetingQuery

###### SUMMARY

Greeting query payload.

###### DESCRIPTION

Structured query input accepted by greeting.

###### VALUE

####### GreetingQuery

######## SUMMARY

Greeting query payload.

######## DESCRIPTION

Typed query input for greeting.

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type | multiplicity |
|-------+------+--------------|
| name  | name | 1            |

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
GreetingResult

###### SUMMARY

Greeting result payload.

###### DESCRIPTION

Structured result returned by greeting.

###### VALUE

####### GreetingResult

######## SUMMARY

Greeting result payload.

######## DESCRIPTION

Typed result returned by greeting.

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type   | multiplicity |
|---------+--------+--------------|
| message | string | 1            |
